<!-- Section 5.15.x — base address printed as <DTSSEL_base> in PDF.  -->
<!-- UNRESOLVED: manual does not give a concrete base address for the  -->
<!-- UPD70F3508 variant in the pages 243-360 range. NOT EMITTED.      -->
