<!-- DTSSELn (n=0..14): 32-bit, address = <DTSSEL_base> + 4*n        -->
<!-- Each register has 8 DSEL bits [7:0] selecting DTS completion      -->
<!-- interrupt enable for 8 channels (a..h mapped per register note).  -->
